Clean up your device by using a unique smart cleaner. You can clean up similar photos and videos with a few taps. You do not only delete similars but can add photos and videos to Secret Albums, as well as contacts to Secret Contacts. Information in Secret Space will be securely hidden from prying eyes with Passcode Protection.

The Organize Contacts feature lets you merge duplicate contacts and fill in missing information in contacts. The Adblocker feature allows you to get rid of annoying ads.
Now, you do not have to download and install multiple apps to organize contacts and free up space on your phone.

Premium Features:
- Easy, fast, and smart cleaning;
- Clean up similar photos and videos;
- Compress Video feature to clean up more memory on your device;
- Organize Contacts;
- Secret Space for files and contacts;
- Protect your data with Passcode Protection;
- Ads blocker;

SUBSCRIPTIONS:
1-month Subscription
1-year Subscription

* Free trial subscription is automatically renewed to a paid subscription.
* Note: unused days of free trial subscription (if applicable) will be lost upon purchasing a premium subscription.
* Subscription or free trial can be canceled any time through iTunes account settings. Cancellation should take place at least 24 hours before the chosen subscription end date. Otherwise, the automatic renewal will take place. Cancellation will be processed on the last day is the current subscription period and you will be automatically switched to free service.

Additional Subscription Information:

- Your iTunes Account will be charged with the payment after purchase confirmation
- Subscription will be automatically renewed at least 24 hours before the end of the current period. Auto-renewal can be manually turned off in the corresponding settings.
- User can manage the subscriptions. Auto-renewal can be deactivated in the Account Settings after a successful purchase

